<div class="auth-card"><div class="verification-icon">✉</div><div class="auth-heading centered"><span class="eyebrow">Email sign-in</span><h2>Check your inbox</h2><p>Enter the six-digit code sent to <b><?= e($email) ?></b>. It expires in 10 minutes and can be used once.</p></div><form method="post" action="<?= url('login/otp') ?>" class="auth-form"><?= csrf_field() ?><label><span>Sign-in code</span><input class="otp-input" name="code" required inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{6}" maxlength="6" autocomplete="one-time-code" autofocus placeholder="000000"><?= error('code')?'<small class="field-error">'.e(error('code')).'</small>':'' ?></label><button class="button button-primary button-block" type="submit">Verify &amp; continue →</button></form><form method="post" action="<?= url('login/otp/resend') ?>" class="auth-resend"><?= csrf_field() ?><span>Didn’t receive it? Check Spam first.</span><button type="submit">Send a new code</button></form><div class="security-note"><span>i</span><p>Never share this code. If it does not arrive, verify the email address or ask an administrator to check SMTP delivery.</p></div><p class="auth-switch"><a href="<?= url('login') ?>">Use a different email address</a></p></div>
